{#
  The wiki index's gemtext: the header, a heading for each first letter, a
  link line for each of its pages, and the footer. Converting
  wiki-index.md.njk would number every link, so the links are written as
  link lines here. The context is the Markdown one's; links go through
  `geminiUrl`.
-#}
{{ header }}

{% for group in wikiGroups %}
## {{ group.letter }}

{% for entry in group.pages %}
=> {{ entry.url | geminiUrl }} {{ entry.label }}
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}
{{ footer }}
